  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PNG Women Lead</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PNG Women Lead supports Gender Equality in PNG and runs complementary to Pacific Women Lead, DFAT&apos;s pacific regional initiative. The goal of PNG Women Lead is that PNG women and girls, in all their diversity, are safe and equitably share in resources, opportunities and decision-making, with men and boys. The objectives of the PNG Women Lead program include enhancing women&#x2019;s voice in decision-making and leadership; Preventing and responding to gender-based violence (GBV); and supporting women&#x2019;s economic empowerment through financial decision making.</narrative>
  </description>
